flowchart TD
    A[PR Marked 'Ready for Review'] --> B{Cost & Scope Guardrails}
    B -->|Passed| C[AST Diff Parser & Filtering]
    B -->|Rejected / Out of Scope| Z[Halt & Skip]
    C --> D[AI Remediation Engine]
    D --> E[Generate Candidate Patch]
    E --> F[Provision Ephemeral Sandbox]
    F --> G[Run Repository Test Suite]
    G --> H{Tests Passed?}
    H -->|No| I[Log Diagnostics / Abandon Patch]
    H -->|Yes| J[Submit Suggested Commits & Explanations]
    J --> K[Mandatory Human Review]
    K -->|Approved| L[Engineer Merges PR]
    K -->|Rejected| M[Discard / Revise Suggestion]